From 101e52731b360436ba585a3537539db757bfb1f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Mausberg <sam@findtensor.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:00:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add env-gated repair probes to the DFlash worker

Per-cycle GPU phase timing (CUDA events, no host sync), reference-continuation
injection, Jacobi recycling and keep policies for the next block, and a probe
mode that runs k extra full verify passes (Jacobi and correct-one sweeps) from
the same committed prefix, restores the GDN conv/SSM state between passes and
commits the plain DFlash pass. Everything is off unless SGLANG_REPAIR_* is set.
---
